# Privacy Policy for WageWyse

**Last updated: 17 September 2026**

WageWyse is developed by **Himbocodes**.

If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at:

**[himbocodes@gmail.com](mailto:himbocodes@gmail.com)**

## Information We Collect

WageWyse is designed to operate without requiring users to create an account or provide personal information directly to us.

WageWyse does not use advertising services and does not collect personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, contacts, or location through the app.

The app stores certain information locally on your device using device storage. This information is used solely to provide the functionality of the app and is not directly transmitted to Himbocodes.

## In-App Purchases

WageWyse uses **RevenueCat** to process and verify in-app purchases and subscriptions.

When you make or restore a purchase, RevenueCat may process information relating to your purchase and an anonymous identifier associated with your use of the app. This information is used to verify your purchase and determine your entitlement to paid features.

RevenueCat may process purchase information and technical information associated with the app. RevenueCat's own privacy practices are described in its Privacy Policy:

https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy/

We do not use purchase information for advertising.

## Data Stored on Your Device

WageWyse may store information locally on your device to provide its features and remember your app settings or data.

This locally stored information remains on your device unless you delete it through the app, clear the app's storage, or uninstall the app.

## Data Sharing

Himbocodes does not sell users' personal information.

Apart from the information processed by RevenueCat in connection with purchase verification, WageWyse does not intentionally share user information with third parties.

## Advertising

WageWyse does not contain advertising and does not use advertising or advertising-tracking services.

## User Accounts

WageWyse does not require users to create an account.

## Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information handled by WageWyse. Information stored locally is subject to the security of the user's device.

Information transmitted to RevenueCat in connection with purchase verification is handled according to RevenueCat's security and privacy practices.

## Data Deletion

Because WageWyse does not require user accounts and stores app data locally on the user's device, users can remove locally stored app data by clearing the app's storage or uninstalling the app.

For questions regarding information processed by RevenueCat in connection with purchases, please contact us at **[himbocodes@gmail.com](mailto:himbocodes@gmail.com)**.

## Children's Privacy

WageWyse does not knowingly collect personal information from children. The app does not require users to create accounts or provide personal information to use its core functionality.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected in the updated version of this policy, together with a new "Last updated" date.

